---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import avatarCjw from '../images/example_image1.png';
import avatarDxy from '../images/example_image2.png';
import avatarSjh from '../images/example_image_3.png';
---

<Base title="关于我们" description="关于 cjw-wjc-qwq 代码小站与三位成员">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>👋 关于我们</h1>
      <p>cjw-wjc-qwq.top 是三个人的公共小站：博客、代码模板、题目解析，外加一个带密码的内部区。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-card">
        <img class="avatar" src={avatarCjw} alt="CJW 头像" />
        <h3>CJW</h3>
        <p>田径队队长</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card">
        <img class="avatar" src={avatarDxy} alt="DXY 头像" />
        <h3>DXY</h3>
        <p>八条</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card">
        <img class="avatar" src={avatarSjh} alt="SJH 头像" />
        <h3>SJH</h3>
        <p>韩国人</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="notice" style="margin-top:26px">
      🛠️ 本站技术栈：<strong>Astro</strong> 静态生成 + <strong>Cloudflare Pages Functions</strong> 密码鉴权，
      <strong>零服务器、零花费</strong>。想一起维护？看 <a href="/guide/">发布指南</a>。
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
